0210412_14.png\"><span><img src=\"/images2021/rsj20210412_32.png\"></span></a></div>\n        <div class=\"search\">\n            <label style=\"position: relative;\">\n                <form id=\"searchform\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" method=\"post\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                    <input name=\"keywords\" type=\"text\" id=\"search1\">\n                    <button class=\"btn1\" id=\"btn1\" type=\"submit\"></button>\n\n                </form>\n            </label>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"menu AllYdCon\">\n    \t<ul>\n            <li><a class=\"hover\" href=\"/\">首页</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/xxgk/index.html\">信息公开</a></li>            <li><a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/wsbs/index.html\">政务服务</a></li>            <li><a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/zmhd/index.html\">政民互动</a></li>            <li><a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/ztfw/index.html\">专题专栏</a></li>        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n$(\"#btn1\").click(function(){\n   if($(\"#search1\").val()==\"\"||$(\"#search1\").val()==null)\n   {alert(\"请输入关键词查询！\");return;}\n   else{\n     var searchform = document.getElementById(\"searchform\");\n     //searchform.action='https://search.gd.gov.cn/search/all/755011/?keywords='+encodeURI($(\"#search1\").val());\n     searchform.action='/fzlm/cjhzthjs/?keywords='+encodeURI($(\"#search1\").val());\n     searchform.method='get';\n     searchform.submit();\n   }\n});\n</script> \n\n<div class=\"conterBg\">\n\t<div class=\"nei_tit\"><a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/\">首页</a>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/szhrss/\">深圳市人力资源和社会保障局</a>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/zmhd/\">政民互动</a>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/zmhd/cjwt/\">常见问题解答</a>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/zmhd/cjwt/cjwt/\">常见问题</a>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://hrss.sz.gov.cn/zmhd/cjwt/cjwt/ldgx/\">劳动关系</a></div>\n\t<div class=\"conter\">\n    \t<div class=\"xx_con\"> \t\n         <div class=\"toutit\">\n        \t<h1>深圳市劳动争议调援裁诉一站式服务平台的查询登录渠道是？平台的具体作用是？深圳哪些区的劳动争议调解仲裁可以在平台上申请？\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t \n            <h6><span>来源：\n\t\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t\tvar datasource = \"深圳市人力资源和社会保障局\"; \n\t\t\t\t\tif (datasource == \"\" || datasource == null || datasource ==\"本网\") {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdatasource = \"深圳市人力资源和社会保障局\";\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.write(datasource);\n\t\t\t\t</script>深圳市人力资源和社会保障局\n\t\t\t\t</span><span>发布日期：2026-04-07 10:46:33</span></h6>\n            </div>\n\n\t\t\t<!-- 归档 -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"float: right; top: 500px;  position: absolute; z-index: 99999; text-align: center; right: 120px; width: 200px; height: 200px; display: none;\" id=\"gd\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- 归档 end-->\n\n       \t  <div class=\"news_cont_d_wrap\">\n            \t<p></p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left;\">　　答：电脑端登录：直接登录深圳市劳动争议调援裁诉一站式服务平台，网址：https://hrsspub.sz.gov.cn/szldzc/login；或进入“深圳市人力资源和社会保障局”官网“劳动关系”版块，点击→“劳动人事仲裁”→“深圳市劳动争议调援裁诉服务平台”进入平台。&nbsp;</p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left;\">　　移动端登录：关注并进入“深圳人社”公众号，在底部菜单点击“办事”—“劳动争议处理”进入小程序。平台汇集调解、仲裁、法律援助、诉讼等多种纠纷解决资源，覆盖劳动争议处理全过程。福田区、罗湖区、南山区、盐田区、宝安区、龙岗区、龙华区、坪山区、光明区、大鹏新区、深汕特别合作区的劳动争议仲裁可以在平台上申请。</p><p></p>\n       \t\t  </div>\n\t\t<div class=\"xqLink\">\n        \t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n<style type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\">\n .fenx_left{ display : none }\n .daying{ display : none }\n\n </style>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/share/share.css\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 30px;float:none;\" class=\"fenx_left\">\n<div class=\"shareIcon\">\n                分享到：<div id=\"share-1\" style=\"display: inline-block;\" data-sites=\"wechat ,weibo, qq, qzone\" class=\"share-component social-share\"><a class=\"social-share-icon icon-wechat\" href=\"javascript:;\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"wechat-qrcode\"><h4>微信扫一扫：分享</h4><div class=\"qrcode\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></div><div class=\"help\"><p>扫一扫，分享给好友或朋友圈</p></div></div></a><a class=\"social-share-icon icon-weibo\" href=\"https://service.weibo.com/share/share.php?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhrss.sz.gov.cn%2Fzmhd%2Fcjwt%2Fcjwt%2Fldgx%2Fcontent%2Fpost_12717688.html&amp;title=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E8%B0%83%E6%8F%B4%E8%A3%81%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%99%E5%BC%8F%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%9F-%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB-%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%92%8C%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%B1%80%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99&amp;pic=https%3A%2F%2Fhrss.sz.gov.cn%2Fimages2021%2Frsj20210412_14.png&amp;appkey=\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a class=\"social-share-icon icon-qq\" href=\"http://connect.qq.com/widget/shareqq/index.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhrss.sz.gov.cn%2Fzmhd%2Fcjwt%2Fcjwt%2Fldgx%2Fcontent%2Fpost_12717688.html&amp;title=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E8%B0%83%E6%8F%B4%E8%A3%81%E8%AF%89%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%99%E5%BC%8F%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E5%8C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E8%B0%83%E8%A7%A3%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%EF%BC%9F-%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB-%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%92%8C%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%B1%80%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99&amp;source=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9